[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764589070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104799#issuecomment-2764589070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104799","id":2764589070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyEgO","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T14:30:15Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T14:30:46Z","body":"I definitely see the appeal of this function: If you're doing this often, I can see having those explicit loops would blow up your boilerplate. \r\nHowever, I think iterating over `Rect` instances is too ambiguous to be a GDScript feature.\r\n\r\nRather, I think it might be a really nice fit though for a custom iterator. It's [possible to do this in GDScript](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_advanced.html#custom-iterators), so as long as the overhead isn't hurting your use case, maybe that would be a decent alternative solution?\r\n(and if they are too slow, perhaps there is something that could be done about that :) )","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764589070/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764592772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104799#issuecomment-2764592772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104799","id":2764592772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyFaE","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T14:39:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T14:39:06Z","body":"The overhead is not tolerable for my use cases.\r\n\r\n> if they are too slow, perhaps there is something that could be done about that :)\r\n\r\nSo, replacing the entire VM/compiler infrastructure with LLVM? I don't think that PR would be accepted either. 😒\r\n\r\nThis PR is a tiny change and imo very nice to have, especially given the special treatment afforded to `Vector2` / `range(x)` in order that they have clean, performant iteration. I built this to solve my use cases and I am sharing it as is. Thanks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764592772/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764593661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104799#issuecomment-2764593661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104799","id":2764593661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyFn9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T14:41:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T14:56:21Z","body":"This is far from a tiny change, it adds new opcodes to the VM which is pretty major IMO\r\n\r\nNote that the \"special treatment\" of `Vector2/3` isn't really that, it's legacy/implementation detail to handle `range` correctly AFAIK","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764593661/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764601088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104799#issuecomment-2764601088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104799","id":2764601088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyHcA","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T15:01:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T15:01:14Z","body":"> So, replacing the entire VM/compiler infrastructure with LLVM? I don't think that PR would be accepted either. 😒\r\n\r\nIndeed, that would be quite a wide reaching change that would probably take a while to be implemented and accepted (although I can definitely see there being a lot of interest in this kind of feature!).\r\n\r\nI'd like to invite you to try using a custom iterator, and if it ends up bottlenecking or considerably slowing down your game, please report this and tag me in the issue. I'm currently pretty invested in improving performance for Godot projects, so perhaps I could help out!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764601088/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]